PDFJS_BUILD_PATH=../../packages/foliate-js/node_modules/pdfjs-dist/legacy/build
PDFJS_FONTS_PATH=../../packages/foliate-js/node_modules/pdfjs-dist
PDFJS_STYLE_PATH=../../packages/foliate-js/vendor/pdfjs

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloud backends and telemetry are NOT configured in this fork.
#
# Upstream Readest ships its own Supabase project, PostHog key and Stripe keys
# here (base64-encoded as NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_*_BASE64). Those are removed on
# purpose: leaving them would send user data to the upstream vendor and let the
# packaged app sign in to someone else's cloud.
#
# The app runs local-only when these are unset. To enable cloud features with
# your own deployment, set the plain (non-base64) variables below — the code
# prefers them over any base64 default:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL / NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   account + cloud sync
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL                                   REST API (sync, share, OPDS proxy, metadata search, Edge TTS)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST / NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY         telemetry (off by default)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY                         hosted checkout
#
# See docs/implementation/BRANDING.md for the full list of upstream touchpoints.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
